Package: delphyr
Title: Reproducible Round-Based Delphi Studies
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("Raban", "Heller", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "58561665+r-heller@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: Validated study protocols, deterministic consensus and longitudinal
    analysis, and transactional PostgreSQL services for round-based Delphi
    studies. Provides reproducible research exports and synthetic examples.
    Production use requires the documented security and operational acceptance
    gates.
